  "description": "The Boardwalk has a classic, elegant look that makes it one of the best-selling folding models of all time. Coming with a lightweight chromoly frame and 7 Shimano speed levels, equipped with DELTECH, get ready to stand out on the streets with style! The DELTECH cable boosts frame strength and stiffness, for easy pedaling and even more secure rides.\n\nPowered by DAHON-V\n\nEasily adjustable in height and angle, this handlebar accommodates various heights and riding postures for a personalized cycling experience\n\nSafety Lock\n\nFeaturing DELTECH—key patents of DAHON-V technology—it offers superior frame rigidity for outstanding speed and safety. This powerful synergy enhances pedaling efficiency, making even uphill rides a breeze.\n\nAluminum Alloy Frame\n\nFeaturing an aesthetically pleasing argon arc welding design, this frame combines vintage colors with elegance for a timeless look\n\nVintage Saddle\n\nWith elegant colors and an ergonomic design, this saddle ensures a comfortable ride for an enjoyable cycling experience\n\nShimano FT35 7-Speed\n\nEquipped with a reliable Shimano FT35 7-speed system, this bike offers smooth shifting and versatility for various terrains.",
